  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 576,
   "width": 556,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 39595,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 523645,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Red dashed: the failed link PE1–P1. PE2 (off P3 and P4) is not\ndrawn.",
   "originalText": "Red dashed: the failed link PE1–P1. PE2 (off P3 and P4) is not\ndrawn.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 626,
   "width": 547,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 47514,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 628374,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Green: the post-convergence path PE1 → P2 → P1 (10 + 30 = 40,\nB14).",
   "originalText": "Green: the post-convergence path PE1 → P2 → P1 (10 + 30 = 40,\nB14).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 676,
   "width": 538,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 55433,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 733103,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Orange: P2’s own (old) path to P1 is P2 → PE1 → P1 (20). It\ncrosses the failed link, so PrefixSID(P1) from P2 would loop\nback. The walk forces the link P2 → P1 instead.",
   "originalText": "Orange: P2’s own (old) path to P1 is P2 → PE1 → P1 (20). It\ncrosses the failed link, so PrefixSID(P1) from P2 would loop\nback. The walk forces the link P2 → P1 instead.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-rectangle-8",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 620,
   "y": 110,
   "width": 1020,
