   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 777,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: from where you are, take the furthest safe Prefix-SID",
   "originalText": "The rule: from where you are, take the furthest safe Prefix-SID",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 558,
   "height": 132,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "current = S\nwhile current ≠ D:\n  Y = furthest router on the path after current with\n      (a) dist(current,Y) = path cost current → Y\n      (b) every old shortest path current → Y avoids S–E  (B1)\n  found?  PrefixSID(Y),               current = Y\n  none?   AdjSID(current → next hop), current = next hop",
   "originalText": "current = S\nwhile current ≠ D:\n  Y = furthest router on the path after current with\n      (a) dist(current,Y) = path cost current → Y\n      (b) every old shortest path current → Y avoids S–E  (B1)\n  found?  PrefixSID(Y),               current = Y\n  none?   AdjSID(current → next hop), current = next hop",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 308,
   "width": 943,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Only S has switched to the repair. Every other router still uses its old table, and a Prefix-SID\n   follows that table. So a segment is safe only if all old paths to its end avoid the failed link.\n•  Furthest first: fewer segments, fewer labels. An Adj-SID moves one hop, so the walk always ends.",
   "originalText": "•  Only S has switched to the repair. Every other router still uses its old table, and a Prefix-SID\n   follows that table. So a segment is safe only if all old paths to its end avoid the failed link.\n•  Furthest first: fewer segments, fewer labels. An Adj-SID moves one hop, so the walk always ends.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 382,
   "width": 437,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 4, step by step (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Example 4, step by step (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 416,
   "width": 782,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "From  Try Y  (a) dist = path?    (b) dist < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)   Segment\n----  -----  ------------------  ------------------------------------------  ----------------\nPE1   P1     10 vs 40   ✗        10 < 0 + 10 + 0  = 10   ✗\nPE1   P2     10 = 10    ✓        10 < 0 + 10 + 20 = 30   ✓                   PrefixSID(P2)\nP2    P1     20 vs 30   ✗        20 < 10 + 10 + 0 = 20   ✗                   AdjSID(P2→P1)",
   "originalText": "From  Try Y  (a) dist = path?    (b) dist < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)   Segment\n----  -----  ------------------  ------------------------------------------  ----------------\nPE1   P1     10 vs 40   ✗        10 < 0 + 10 + 0  = 10   ✗\nPE1   P2     10 = 10    ✓        10 < 0 + 10 + 20 = 30   ✓                   PrefixSID(P2)\nP2    P1     20 vs 30   ✗        20 < 10 + 10 + 0 = 20   ✗                   AdjSID(P2→P1)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 514,
   "width": 572,
   "height": 70,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "walk      [PrefixSID(P2), AdjSID(P2→P1)]\nclean-up  drop PrefixSID(P2): it only reaches the first hop  (B16)\nend       add PrefixSID(P1), the destination’s own label       (B17)\nresult    [AdjSID(P2→P1), PrefixSID(P1)] = 24000, 16001, out via P2",
   "originalText": "walk      [PrefixSID(P2), AdjSID(P2→P1)]\nclean-up  drop PrefixSID(P2): it only reaches the first hop  (B16)\nend       add PrefixSID(P1), the destination’s own label       (B17)\nresult    [AdjSID(P2→P1), PrefixSID(P1)] = 24000, 16001, out via P2",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 594,
   "width": 650,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 3, S → C (ring, B–C = 10): a jump, then a forced link",
   "originalText": "Example 3, S → C (ring, B–C = 10): a jump, then a forced link",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b15-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 628,
   "width": 773,
   "height": 70,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S    C   2 vs 12  ✗   2 < 0 + 1 + 1 = 2   ✗\nS    B   2 = 2    ✓   2 < 0 + 1 + 3 = 4   ✓   PrefixSID(B)\nB    C   4 vs 10  ✗   4 < 2 + 1 + 1 = 4   ✗   AdjSID(B→C)   (B’s old path B → A → S → E → C)\n→  [PrefixSID(B), AdjSID(B→C), PrefixSID(C)] = 16004, 24005, 16005",
   "originalText": "S    C   2 vs 12  ✗   2 < 0 + 1 + 1 = 2   ✗\nS    B   2 = 2    ✓   2 < 0 + 1 + 3 = 4   ✓   PrefixSID(B)\nB    C   4 vs 10  ✗   4 < 2 + 1 + 1 = 4   ✗   AdjSID(B→C)   (B’s old path B → A → S → E → C)\n→  [PrefixSID(B), AdjSID(B→C), PrefixSID(C)] = 16004, 24005, 16005",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
